Sat Aug 10 14:05:45 UTC 2019 - Luigi Baldoni <aloisio@gmx.com>

- Update to version 2.0.0
  * Major update in the upstream source base, with support for
    new profiles and features, and numerous crash/fuzz fixes.
    The new upstream version is referred to as FDKv2, thus
    skipping the major version 1 and syncing the fdk-aac major
    version number to 2.

